<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<h1 style="text-align: center;"><strong>September Events</strong></h1>
<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter"><a href="https://writersguildbloomington.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/February-WG-Home-Image.webp"><img decoding="async" width="202" height="300" class="wp-image-5127" src="https://writersguildbloomington.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/February-WG-Home-Image-202x300.webp" alt="" srcset="https://writersguildbloomington.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/February-WG-Home-Image-202x300.webp 202w, https://writersguildbloomington.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/February-WG-Home-Image.webp 242w" sizes="(max-width: 202px) 100vw, 202px" /></a></figure>





<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Writers Guild Spoken Word Stage at the Fourth Street Festival </strong>is September 5th from 10:00am-6:00pm at Fourth Street and Grant</p>





<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Writers Guild Spoken Word Stage at the Fourth Street Festival </strong>is September 6th from 10:00am-5:00pm at Fourth Street and Grant</p>
<p><strong>First Sunday Prose </strong>is September 6th  from 4:00-5:30pm at The Juniper Art Gallery and Cafe, 615 W. Kirkwood Avenue</p>
<p><strong>Last Sunday Poetry Reading &amp; Open Mic</strong> is September 27th from 7:00pm-8:30pm at Morgenstern Books &amp; Cafe (849 S Auto Mall Rd) </p>
</div>
